  "releaseNotes": "Version: 5.0.2\nAvailability: .NET 10 and .NET 9\n# ALM\n- CHANGED Dependencies have been upgraded to the latest compatible versions for all supported target frameworks (TFMs)\nVersion: 5.0.1\nAvailability: .NET 10 and .NET 9\n \n# ALM\n- CHANGED Dependencies have been upgraded to the latest compatible versions for all supported target frameworks (TFMs)\n \nVersion: 5.0.0\nAvailability: .NET 10 and .NET 9\n \n# ALM\n- ADDED Support for TFM .NET 10 (LTS)\n- REMOVED Support for TFM .NET 8 (LTS)\n- CHANGED Dependencies have been upgraded to the latest compatible versions for all supported target frameworks (TFMs)\n \nVersion: 4.4.2\nAvailability: .NET 9 and .NET 8\n \n# ALM\n- CHANGED Dependencies have been upgraded to the latest compatible versions for all supported target frameworks (TFMs)\n \nVersion: 4.4.1\nAvailability: .NET 9 and .NET 8\n \n# ALM\n- CHANGED Dependencies have been upgraded to the latest compatible versions for all supported target frameworks (TFMs)\n \nVersion: 4.4.0\nAvailability: .NET 9 and .NET 8\n \n# ALM\n- CHANGED Dependencies have been upgraded to the latest compatible versions for all supported target frameworks (TFMs)\n \nVersion: 4.3.0\nAvailability: .NET 9 and .NET 8\n \n# New Features\n- ADDED ServiceCollectionExtensions class in the Savvyio.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Text.Json namespace that consist of extension methods for the IServiceCollection interface: AddJsonMarshaller",
